Fetch record: research/upstream-install-manifest.json.
Vendored inventory: skills/SKILLS_MANIFEST.json.

One requested repository, https://github.com/smeltery/skills, was unavailable
at fetch time (the installer received a non-tarball response). The
`improve-codebase-architecture` skill required for the architecture pass was
obtained from mattpocock/skills, which carries it, and is vendored at
skills/mattpocock/improve-codebase-architecture/.

These skills were read as workflow guidance during development. They are
included here so the build is reproducible and attributable. Users should
review upstream SKILL.md files before invoking them in their own agents.
